  "brain_first": "“看它修饰谁：名词要形容词，动词/形容词/整句常要副词；再看 有没有比较。”",
  "sort_order": 1052,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "RECOGNISE - How it usually looks",
      "sourcePage": 80,
      "sourceIndex": 2205
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "括号给 quick, careful, significant 等。",
      "sourcePage": 80,
      "sourceIndex": 2206
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "TERM - What the term really means",
      "sourcePage": 80,
      "sourceIndex": 2207
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Adjective vs adverb + comparative/",
      "sourcePage": 80,
      "sourceIndex": 2208
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "superlative。",
      "sourcePage": 80,
      "sourceIndex": 2209
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "THINK - First sentence in your head: “看它修饰谁：名词要形容词，动词/形容词/整句常要副词；再看",
      "sourcePage": 80,
      "sourceIndex": 2210
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "有没有比较。”",
      "sourcePage": 80,
      "sourceIndex": 2211
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "WHY - Why this works: 这是最容易通过位置判断拿分的一类。",
      "sourcePage": 80,
      "sourceIndex": 2212
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "STEPS - Follow this route",
      "sourcePage": 80,
      "sourceIndex": 2213
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "1 空后直接是名词 → 优先形容词。",
      "sourcePage": 80,
      "sourceIndex": 2214
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "2 空修饰动词/形容词/另一副词 → 优先副词。",
      "sourcePage": 80,
      "sourceIndex": 2215
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "3 be/seem/become/feel 后常接形容词作表语。",
      "sourcePage": 80,
      "sourceIndex": 2216
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "4 出现 than / among / of all / much / even 时检查比较级或最高级。",
      "sourcePage": 80,
      "sourceIndex": 2217
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "✏ 草稿纸上具体写什么： 空格前后各画一条短线；标 pronoun? / contrast? / cause? / example?；两个",
      "sourcePage": 80,
      "sourceIndex": 2218
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "纠结选项写 A/B 再逐条验指代与逻辑。",
      "sourcePage": 80,
      "sourceIndex": 2219
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "IF/THEN - If... then...",
      "sourcePage": 80,
      "sourceIndex": 2220
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· than → 常提示 comparative",
      "sourcePage": 80,
      "sourceIndex": 2221
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· the + ___ + in/of → 常提示 superlative",
      "sourcePage": 80,
      "sourceIndex": 2222
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· significantly cheaper = 副词修饰比较级",
      "sourcePage": 80,
      "sourceIndex": 2223
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "STOP - Stop when: 修饰对象和比较关系都正确。",
      "sourcePage": 80,
      "sourceIndex": 2224
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "STUCK - If you are stuck: 如果不知道词形，先写词根再套高频后缀：-ly, -er/-est, more/most。",
      "sourcePage": 80,
      "sourceIndex": 2225
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "EXAMPLE - Worked example",
      "sourcePage": 80,
      "sourceIndex": 2226
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "Prices were significantly ___ (cheap) than those in supermarkets. than → comparative → cheaper。",
      "sourcePage": 80,
      "sourceIndex": 2227
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "TRAPS - Common traps",
      "sourcePage": 80,
      "sourceIndex": 2228
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· 看到形容词原形就原样抄。",
      "sourcePage": 80,
      "sourceIndex": 2229
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· 比较级前忘记much/even可以修饰。",
      "sourcePage": 80,
      "sourceIndex": 2230
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "CHECK - Final check",
      "sourcePage": 81,
      "sourceIndex": 2231
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· 修饰谁？",
      "sourcePage": 81,
      "sourceIndex": 2232
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "· 有than/范围吗？",
      "sourcePage": 81,
      "sourceIndex": 2233
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "🔧 纠错动作： 做完不要只对答案，先给错误归类。错误代码： 7-P 代词指代｜7-L 逻辑关系｜7-T 主题链",
      "sourcePage": 81,
      "sourceIndex": 2234
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "｜7-O 位置不合理｜7-R 内容重复。",
      "sourcePage": 81,
      "sourceIndex": 2235
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "同一种错误连续出现2次 → 在对应代码旁画★，下次做题先检查这一项。",
      "sourcePage": 81,
      "sourceIndex": 2236
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "MEMORY - 30-second memory: 形副词：先看修饰谁，再看比较。",
      "sourcePage": 81,
      "sourceIndex": 2237
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "可选巩固｜5题（查完SOP后再做）",
      "sourcePage": 81,
      "sourceIndex": 2239
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "1. quick修饰动词需要？",
      "sourcePage": 81,
      "sourceIndex": 2240
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "2. than出现通常警觉？",
      "sourcePage": 81,
      "sourceIndex": 2241
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "3. one of the ___ buildings (tall)",
      "sourcePage": 81,
      "sourceIndex": 2242
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "4. much + 比较级，如 much ___ (easy)",
      "sourcePage": 81,
      "sourceIndex": 2243
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "5. 形容词修饰名词、副词修饰动作，这条能否绝对覆盖？",
      "sourcePage": 81,
      "sourceIndex": 2244
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "答案速查：1. quickly；2. 比较级；3. tallest；4. easier；5. 不是全部，但可作第一筛选。",
      "sourcePage": 81,
      "sourceIndex": 2245
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "— GF4 本题型到这里。下次卡住直接 Ctrl+F 搜“GF4”或题型关键词。—",
      "sourcePage": 81,
      "sourceIndex": 2246
    }
